# gorbenko.at — Project Context

## Stack
- Next.js 16 (App Router), TypeScript, Tailwind v4
- Deployed on Vercel → **gorbenko.at**
- No `tailwind.config.js` — tokens in `app/globals.css` via `@theme inline`

## Design Tokens (`app/globals.css`)
```css
--background: #050508
--foreground: #f0f0f0
--accent: #00d4aa        /* teal — primary brand color */
--muted: #6b7280
--card: #0a0a0f
--border: #1a1a22
```
Font: Geist (via `next/font/google`), vars `--font-geist-sans` / `--font-geist-mono`

## File Structure
```
app/
  layout.tsx          — root layout, GTM scripts, CookieConsent
  page.tsx            — main landing (/)
  google-maps/page.tsx — cold outreach landing for Vienna cafés
  impressum/page.tsx  — legal (ECG §5, MedienG §25)
  datenschutz/page.tsx — DSGVO privacy policy
  components/
    Header.tsx / Footer.tsx / Hero.tsx / Problem.tsx
    Process.tsx / CaseStudy.tsx / Pricing.tsx / About.tsx
    Contact.tsx / CookieConsent.tsx
```

