## Coding Conventions
- Buttons: `<a>` with `rounded-full bg-[var(--accent)] px-8 py-4 font-semibold text-[var(--background)]`
- Cards: `rounded-2xl border border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--card)] p-7`
- Section eyebrow: `text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[var(--accent)]`
- All copy is German (de-AT), HTML entities for umlauts (ä→`&auml;` etc.)
- No Button component — use `<a>` tags directly
- `"use client"` only where state/effects needed
